## Returning Errors from Handlers

```go
app.Get("/user/:id", func(c *fiber.Ctx) error {
    id := c.Params("id")

    user, err := getUserByID(id)
    if err != nil {
        // Return error - will be caught by error handler
        return err
    }

    return c.JSON(user)
})
```

